# Worktrees for in-progress branch work (EnterWorktree) — ephemeral, never a commit
# target. Without this, `git add -A`/`git add .` from the primary checkout while a
# worktree exists as a sibling directory picks it up as a gitlink (mode 160000)
# instead of skipping it, since it contains its own `.git` file.
.claude/worktrees/
